 "summary": {
  "ja": [
   "スイスの観光列車、氷河特急の 2 等パノラマ客車（シュタッドラー製、2006〜07 年）を、おもちゃの車台に載る大きさで起こした 3D モデル。赤い端に白い十字のかけら、淡い氷河の青の中央、屋根の肩まで回り込む窓。寸法は写真から、遠近を補正して読んだ。"
  ],
  "en": [
   "3D model of a 2nd-class panoramic coach (Stadler, 2006-07) of the Glacier Express, the Swiss scenic train, sized to sit on a toy chassis. Red ends with white Swiss-cross pieces, a pale glacier-blue middle and glazing that wraps up over the roof shoulders. Dimensions were read from photographs, corrected for perspective."
  ]
 },
